WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Finance/PMO opens the budget workspace and current project economics.

00:05.000 --> 00:12.500
Budget inputs recalculate labour, travel, total cost, margin and approval route.

00:12.500 --> 00:18.000
The calculated version is explicitly confirmed and submitted for approval.

00:18.000 --> 00:27.000
The Budget Approver reviews the immutable economics and records an approval.

00:27.000 --> 00:37.500
The Practitioner enters an allocation-eligible 40-hour week and submits it for review.

00:37.500 --> 00:45.500
The Reporting Manager validates the accepted allocation and approves the timesheet.
